message: "If you use this software, its audit findings, or its benchmark results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "beyond-dijkstra: the first implementation of the Duan–Mao–Shu–Yin O(m√(log n·log log n)) directed SSSP algorithm, with an audit and a completeness proof"
authors:
  - family-names: Khobotov
    given-names: Nikolai
